e Bottom Sheet specifically the iOS implementation, placing any content inside the sheet causes the content to recompose if I slightly drag the sheet downwards and let it snap back to its original height without dismissing it. What I did exactly was I used the Adaptive Bottom Sheet in my iOS module and placed a WebView inside it [also from calf]. dragging the sheet and letting it go back to its original height recomposes the webview inside which causes my webview to reload.\r\nHere's a small code snippet:\r\n```\r\nAdaptiveBottomSheet(\r\n                    onDismissRequest = {  },\r\n                    adaptiveSheetState =\r\n                        rememberAdaptiveSheetState(),\r\n                ) {\r\n                    WebView(\r\n                        state = state,\r\n                    )\r\n                }\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","id":41842296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODQyMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41842296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/75/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"r